"\n\nWhat happened: %@." = "\n\n發生的情況：%@。";
"\"%@\" already exists in your library. Replacing it can't be undone." = "「%@」已存在於你的遊戲庫中。取代後無法復原。";
"\"%@\" doesn't say. Desktop Cemu's are named ..._vkpipeline.bin and MuffinEMU's ..._mtlpipeline.bin. It's stored under the matching name either way." = "「%@」沒有註明。桌面版 Cemu 的檔名為 ..._vkpipeline.bin，MuffinEMU 的為 ..._mtlpipeline.bin。無論哪種，都會以相符的名稱儲存。";
"\"%@\" is a cache for %@, but none of its %d entries can be used." = "「%@」是 %@ 的快取，但其中 %d 個項目都無法使用。";
