"\"%@\" is a cache for another game (title ID %@), not %@. Nothing was imported." = "「%@」是其他遊戲（標題 ID %@）的快取，不是 %@ 的。未匯入任何內容。";
"\"%@\" is a learned-shader cache from a desktop Cemu older than 1.16, which keyed shaders differently. It can't be converted. Use a cache from Cemu 1.16 or newer, or from MuffinEMU." = "「%@」是舊於 1.16 版的桌面版 Cemu 的已學習著色器快取，其著色器的索引方式不同，無法轉換。請使用 Cemu 1.16 以上或 MuffinEMU 的快取。";
"\"%@\" is a learned-shader cache, not a pipeline cache. Use \"Import learned shaders\" for it." = "「%@」是已學習著色器的快取，不是管線快取。請改用「匯入已學習的著色器」。";
"\"%@\" is a pipeline cache, not learned shaders. Use \"Import shader pipeline caches\" for it." = "「%@」是管線快取，不是已學習的著色器。請改用「匯入著色器管線快取」。";
"\"%@\" is only linked, so its file stays where it is and isn't deleted. Your saves and options are kept. You can bring it back from Settings > Library." = "「%@」只是連結，因此其檔案會留在原處，不會被刪除。你的存檔和選項會保留。你可以從「設定」>「遊戲庫」將它找回來。";
"\"%@\" is stored on a drive or folder MuffinEMU can't reach right now. Connect the drive, then try again." = "「%@」儲存在 MuffinEMU 目前無法存取的磁碟機或檔案夾中。請連接磁碟機，然後再試一次。";
"\"%@\" isn't a Wii U game dump. A dump folder needs code, content and meta folders inside it, or an encrypted game folder: title.tmd and title.tik next to its .app files." = "「%@」不是 Wii U 遊戲備份。備份檔案夾內需要有 code、content 和 meta 檔案夾，或是加密的遊戲檔案夾：.app 檔案旁要有 title.tmd 和 title.tik。";
"\"%@\" isn't a Wii U game file MuffinEMU can read. It accepts .wua, .wux, .wud, .iso, .rpx, .elf and .wuhb files." = "「%@」不是 MuffinEMU 可以讀取的 Wii U 遊戲檔案。支援 .wua、.wux、.wud、.iso、.rpx、.elf 和 .wuhb 檔案。";
"\"%@\" isn't a shader cache file, or it's damaged. Pick a .bin file from a Cemu or MuffinEMU shaderCache folder." = "「%@」不是著色器快取檔案，或已損毀。請從 Cemu 或 MuffinEMU 的 shaderCache 檔案夾中選取 .bin 檔案。";
