"A custom server is a community-run replacement for Nintendo's Wii U online services. Whoever runs it gives you a network_services.xml file, or the addresses to enter here.\n\nThe active server is saved to Documents/mlc/network_services.xml.\n\nCustom doesn't need a linked account or otp.bin and seeprom.bin: the server decides what it needs. Pretendo does need them." = "自訂伺服器是由社群營運、用來取代 Nintendo Wii U 線上服務的伺服器。營運者會提供 network_services.xml 檔案，或是要在此輸入的位址。\n\n使用中的伺服器會儲存到 Documents/mlc/network_services.xml。\n\n自訂不需要已連結的帳號，也不需要 otp.bin 和 seeprom.bin：需要什麼由伺服器決定。Pretendo 則需要這些。";
