"A pipeline only loads when the shaders it uses are in the game's learned shaders, so import those too." = "管線只有在其使用的著色器位於遊戲已學習的著色器中時才會載入，因此也請一併匯入那些著色器。";
"A self-hosted server for Monster Hunter 3 Ultimate, built to stand in for Nintendo's Wii U online servers. It doesn't need a Wii U or a console dump. Someone runs the host on a computer and gives you a network_services.xml, which you import above." = "這是 Monster Hunter 3 Ultimate 的自行架設伺服器，用來取代 Nintendo 的 Wii U 線上伺服器。不需要 Wii U 或主機備份。由某人在電腦上執行主機，並提供 network_services.xml 給你，再於上方匯入。";
"A shader cache is what a game has saved so the next start skips building its shaders again. Size on disk is everything saved for this game, and Last updated is the last time any of it changed.\n\nClear this game's shaders lets you remove just the compiled ones (one slow start, nothing else lost) or everything including the learned ones (the game stutters while it relearns them).\n\nAdvanced mode also shows how many shaders and pipelines are saved for the renderer you've selected, splits the size into learned and compiled, and can export this game's Metal shader files to Files, for backing up or moving to another device. The counts are hidden while a game is running. The settings under Settings > Shaders cover every game at once." = "著色器快取是遊戲儲存起來的內容，讓下次啟動時可以略過重新建置著色器。「磁碟大小」是為此遊戲儲存的全部內容，「上次更新」是其中任何內容最後一次變動的時間。\n\n「清除此遊戲的著色器」可讓你只移除已編譯的著色器（會慢速啟動一次，不會遺失其他內容），或是全部移除，包括已學習的著色器（遊戲在重新學習期間會卡頓）。\n\n進階模式還會顯示你所選轉譯器已儲存的著色器和管線數量，將大小分為已學習與已編譯，並可將此遊戲的 Metal 著色器檔案匯出到「檔案」，以便備份或移到其他裝置。遊戲執行期間會隱藏數量。「設定」>「著色器」中的設定適用於所有遊戲。";
