"Art packs are community collections of cover art, most of them 3D boxes. Download one and MuffinEMU matches its images to your games by title and region.\n\nThe download needs free space for the file and for the unpacked images at the same time; MuffinEMU checks first and says if there isn't enough. Keep MuffinEMU open while a pack downloads. Cancel stops it and cleans up.\n\nPacks are stored where Files can't see them, and aren't included in device backups, since they can be downloaded again." = "美術包是社群製作的封面圖集合，大多是 3D 盒裝。下載一個後，MuffinEMU 會依標題和地區將其圖片對應到你的遊戲。\n\n下載時需要同時有足夠空間容納檔案和解開後的圖片；MuffinEMU 會先檢查，空間不足時會告知。套件包下載期間請保持 MuffinEMU 開啟。取消會停止並清理。\n\n套件包儲存在「檔案」看不到的位置，且不包含在裝置備份中，因為可以重新下載。";
