"Compile shaders in the background builds shaders while the game keeps running. Most games want this on; Nano Assault Neo breaks with it, so it can be set per game.\n\nPerformance profile picks the trade-off for this game: Speed, Accuracy (slower but more accurate, on one CPU core; can fix a game that glitches or crashes) or Battery saver (one CPU core).\n\nResolution changes how large the picture is drawn for this game.\n\nSwitch Settings mode to Advanced on Settings > General to set CPU cores, the scaling filters and Steady frame rate for this game too." = "「在背景編譯著色器」會在遊戲持續執行的同時建置著色器。大多數遊戲都適合開啟；Nano Assault Neo 開啟後會出問題，因此可以針對各遊戲設定。\n\n「效能設定檔」為此遊戲選擇取捨：速度、準確度（較慢但較準確，使用單一 CPU 核心；可修正出現異常或當機的遊戲）或省電（單一 CPU 核心）。\n\n「解析度」會改變此遊戲繪製畫面的大小。\n\n在「設定」>「一般」中將「設定模式」切換為「進階」，也可以為此遊戲設定 CPU 核心、縮放濾鏡和穩定畫面更新率。";
"Compile shaders in the background builds shaders while the game keeps running. Most games want this on; Nano Assault Neo breaks with it.\n\nPerformance profile picks the trade-off for this game: Speed, Accuracy (slower but more accurate, on one CPU core; can fix a game that glitches or crashes) or Battery saver (one CPU core).\n\nResolution and the two scaling filters change how the picture is drawn for this game.\n\nCPU cores picks how many cores run the game. Auto decides for each game and device." = "「在背景編譯著色器」會在遊戲持續執行的同時建置著色器。大多數遊戲都適合開啟；Nano Assault Neo 開啟後會出問題。\n\n「效能設定檔」為此遊戲選擇取捨：速度、準確度（較慢但較準確，使用單一 CPU 核心；可修正出現異常或當機的遊戲）或省電（單一 CPU 核心）。\n\n「解析度」和兩種縮放濾鏡會改變此遊戲繪製畫面的方式。\n\n「CPU 核心」選擇用多少個核心執行遊戲。「自動」會依每個遊戲和裝置決定。";
