"Display gamma adjusts how bright the mid-tones look without changing pure black or pure white. 2.2 is the standard display gamma and the default; lower looks flatter and brighter in the mids, higher looks more contrasty and darker in the mids. Takes effect on the next frame." = "「顯示器 Gamma」會調整中間調看起來的亮度，而不改變純黑或純白。2.2 是標準的顯示器 Gamma，也是預設值；較低時中間調較平淡明亮，較高時中間調對比較強、較暗。於下一個影格生效。";
"Display is this device's screen. External Display is a TV or second screen. Audio, the performance overlay and pop-up notifications are here too." = "「顯示器」是此裝置的螢幕。「外接顯示器」是電視或第二螢幕。音訊、效能疊層和彈出通知也在這裡。";
