"Downloading GameTDB database" = "正在下載 GameTDB 資料庫";
"Drag a button along its arc, or in and out. Presses do nothing while you do." = "沿著弧線或向內向外拖移按鈕。拖移期間按下不會有任何作用。";
"Drag a button to move it. Positions are saved for this game only; the size applies to every game." = "拖移按鈕即可移動。位置只會儲存於此遊戲；大小則適用於所有遊戲。";
"Drag a group of buttons to move it, or pinch it to resize it. Nothing here reaches the game." = "拖移一組按鈕即可移動，或用兩指縮放來調整大小。這裡的內容都不會傳送給遊戲。";
"Drag any button to move it on its own, or pinch it to resize. L and ZL move together, and so do R and ZR. Nothing here reaches the game." = "拖移任何按鈕即可單獨移動，或用兩指縮放來調整大小。L 與 ZL 會一起移動，R 與 ZR 也是。這裡的內容都不會傳送給遊戲。";
"Drag the circle. The grey dot is where your thumb is; the blue dot is what the game is sent, after everything below and your calibration. Nothing here reaches the game." = "拖移圓圈。灰點是你拇指的位置；藍點是經過下方所有設定和你的校正後傳送給遊戲的值。這裡的內容都不會傳送給遊戲。";
"Drag the empty space inside a dashed box to move that whole half - L/ZL and the rest of the left side together, R/ZR and the right side together. Nothing here reaches the game." = "拖移虛線框內的空白處即可移動整個半邊——L/ZL 與左側其餘部分一起，R/ZR 與右側一起。這裡的內容都不會傳送給遊戲。";
"Draws effects that this device's GPU can't run natively. Experimental, and off by default. Takes effect on the next game launch." = "繪製此裝置的 GPU 無法原生執行的效果。實驗性功能，預設為關閉。於下次遊戲啟動時生效。";
