"Each game is slow to start once while it rebuilds. Nothing else is lost." = "每個遊戲在重建時會慢速啟動一次。不會遺失其他內容。";
"Each of these games keeps its own value instead of following Settings. Open one to change it or reset it." = "這些遊戲各自保有自己的值，而不是依照「設定」。開啟其中一個即可變更或重置。";
