"Emulates a Skylanders Portal, Disney Infinity Base or LEGO Dimensions Toypad. Changes apply the next time you start a game." = "模擬 Skylanders 傳送門、Disney Infinity 底座或 LEGO Dimensions Toypad。變更會在你下次啟動遊戲時生效。";
"Enable" = "啟用";
"Encrypted Wii U games need a keys.txt dumped from your own Wii U. MuffinEMU doesn't include one. Homebrew doesn't need it." = "加密的 Wii U 遊戲需要從你自己的 Wii U 備份出來的 keys.txt。MuffinEMU 不含金鑰。自製軟體不需要。";
"Encrypted games (.wux, .wud, .iso) need AES keys dumped from your own Wii U, in a text file called keys.txt with one key per line. MuffinEMU doesn't include keys.\n\nYou can also open MuffinEMU in the Files app and drop keys.txt into the \"keys\" folder.\n\nNew keys are used the next time you start a game. If you've already started a game since opening MuffinEMU, quit and reopen MuffinEMU first." = "加密的遊戲（.wux、.wud、.iso）需要從你自己的 Wii U 備份出來的 AES 金鑰，放在名為 keys.txt 的文字檔中，每行一個金鑰。MuffinEMU 不含金鑰。\n\n你也可以在「檔案」App 中開啟 MuffinEMU，並將 keys.txt 放入「keys」檔案夾。\n\n新金鑰會在你下次啟動遊戲時使用。如果你開啟 MuffinEMU 後已啟動過遊戲，請先結束並重新開啟 MuffinEMU。";
"Encrypted games need Wii U keys, so they come first. Then how your games look and where cover art comes from." = "加密的遊戲需要 Wii U 金鑰，所以排在最前面。接著是遊戲的外觀，以及封面圖的來源。";
"Encrypted games won't run until you import a keys.txt again. Homebrew is unaffected." = "在你再次匯入 keys.txt 之前，加密的遊戲將無法執行。自製軟體不受影響。";
