"Every button goes back to where Zone puts it, in every game that doesn't have its own layout." = "每個按鈕都會回到 Zone 放置的位置，適用於所有沒有自己版面的遊戲。";
"Every button goes back to where Zone puts it, in this game." = "每個按鈕都會回到 Zone 放置的位置，適用於此遊戲。";
"Every control style now uses your calibration. Run it again any time, or reset it from the stick settings." = "現在所有控制樣式都會使用你的校正。隨時可以再次執行，或從搖桿設定中重置。";
"Every game" = "所有遊戲";
"Every group (shoulders, sticks, d-pad, A/B/X/Y, Start, Select, HOME) can be dragged and pinch-resized. Tap the move icon in the top bar during a game.\n\nFit floats the controls over the screen. Native sizes the picture to fit around the controls: small on a phone, life-size on an iPad.\n\nThis pad is experimental." = "每一組（肩鍵、搖桿、方向鍵、A/B/X/Y、Start、Select、HOME）都可以拖移並用兩指縮放。在遊戲中點一下頂端列的移動圖示。\n\n「適應」會讓控制項浮在螢幕上。「原生」會調整畫面大小以容納在控制項周圍：在 iPhone 上較小，在 iPad 上為實際大小。\n\n此搖桿面板為實驗性功能。";
"Every group goes back to the preset's own position and size, in every game. The preset, colours and picture mode you picked stay as they are." = "每一組都會在所有遊戲中回到預設組合自己的位置和大小。你選擇的預設組合、顏色和畫面模式維持不變。";
"Every group goes back to the preset's own positions and sizes. The preset, colours and picture mode you picked are untouched." = "每一組都會回到預設組合自己的位置和大小。你選擇的預設組合、顏色和畫面模式不受影響。";
"Every menu here starts with \"Same as Settings\", which follows the matching setting in Settings, even if you change it later. Picking anything else sets it for this game only and puts a dot beside it.\n\nScreen layout and Hide on-screen controls when a controller is connected are put in place when the game starts, and your own choices come back when it stops. A layout change you make during the game is not kept.\n\nPerformance overlay On uses the corner chosen in Settings, or the top left if Settings has it off.\n\nChanges apply the next time you start the game." = "這裡的每個選單都以「與設定相同」開頭，會跟隨「設定」中對應的設定，即使你之後變更也一樣。選擇其他選項則只為此遊戲設定，並在旁邊顯示圓點。\n\n「螢幕版面」和「連接控制器時隱藏螢幕控制」會在遊戲啟動時套用，遊戲停止時恢復你自己的選擇。你在遊戲期間做的版面變更不會保留。\n\n「效能疊層」開啟時使用「設定」中選擇的角落；如果「設定」中是關閉，則使用左上角。\n\n變更會在你下次啟動此遊戲時生效。";
"Every setting you've changed, and games with settings of their own." = "你變更過的每項設定，以及有自己設定的遊戲。";
"Every setting you've changed, wherever it is. Tap one to go to it." = "你變更過的每項設定，無論位於何處。點一下即可前往。";
"Everything else" = "其他所有項目";
"Everything is at its default." = "全部都是預設值。";
"Everything is shown, including the settings most people never need." = "顯示全部，包括大多數人用不到的設定。";
"Everything the Menu needs to start is present." = "選單啟動所需的一切都已齊全。";
"Exact title ID" = "完整標題 ID";
"Existing %@ saved as %@." = "已將現有的 %@ 儲存為 %@。";
"Expanded" = "展開";
"Experimental" = "實驗性";
"Experimental. Files must be dumped from your own Wii U. Nothing is included." = "實驗性功能。檔案必須從你自己的 Wii U 備份。不含任何檔案。";
"Experimental. Replaces the normal pad while on." = "實驗性功能。開啟時會取代一般的搖桿面板。";
"Experimental. Sends a Wii U screen to a connected second display." = "實驗性功能。將 Wii U 螢幕傳送到已連接的第二個顯示器。";
"Experimental. The Wii U Menu and its support files must come from your own Wii U, dumped with Dumpling. MuffinEMU includes none of them.\n\nImport Wii U Menu: pick the package folder (the one containing mlc01 and cafeLibs), an mlc01 folder, a sys folder, a cafeLibs folder, or the Menu's own title folder. Files are merged one by one into MuffinEMU's storage; anything replaced is saved first, and your saves are never touched.\n\nImport console files: pick otp.bin and seeprom.bin. Only online features need them; the Menu may start without.\n\nOnce the Menu is installed it appears at the top of the library. Games in your library show up in it. You can show it as a card in the game grid instead, or hide it from the library; hiding doesn't uninstall it.\n\nUninstall Wii U Menu deletes only the Menu itself. Shared data, system apps, cafeLibs, otp.bin and seeprom.bin stay, since games can use them. Your saves and your games are never touched." = "實驗性功能。Wii U Menu 及其支援檔案必須來自你自己的 Wii U，並以 Dumpling 備份。MuffinEMU 不含其中任何檔案。\n\n匯入 Wii U Menu：選取套件檔案夾（內含 mlc01 和 cafeLibs 的那個）、mlc01 檔案夾、sys 檔案夾、cafeLibs 檔案夾，或選單本身的標題檔案夾。檔案會逐一合併到 MuffinEMU 的儲存空間；任何被取代的內容會先儲存，你的存檔絕不會被動到。\n\n匯入主機檔案：選取 otp.bin 和 seeprom.bin。只有線上功能需要它們；選單沒有它們也可能啟動。\n\n安裝選單後，它會出現在遊戲庫最上方。你遊戲庫中的遊戲會顯示在其中。你也可以改為在遊戲格狀中以卡片顯示，或從遊戲庫隱藏；隱藏不會解除安裝。\n\n「解除安裝 Wii U Menu」只會刪除選單本身。共用資料、系統 App、cafeLibs、otp.bin 和 seeprom.bin 都會保留，因為遊戲可能會用到。你的存檔和遊戲絕不會被動到。";
"Experimental. Turn it on before connecting a second screen." = "實驗性功能。請在連接第二個螢幕之前開啟。";
"Experimental. Turn it on, then connect a second screen." = "實驗性功能。請開啟，然後連接第二個螢幕。";
"Experimental: Vulkan runs through MoltenVK on top of Metal. Some games may draw wrongly or stop, and if Vulkan fails the next launch switches back to Metal." = "實驗性：Vulkan 透過 MoltenVK 在 Metal 之上執行。部分遊戲可能繪製錯誤或停止，若 Vulkan 失敗，下次啟動會切換回 Metal。";
"Export all settings" = "匯出所有設定";
"Export all settings writes one .json file to Files: every setting, and the settings you've set for individual games. It never includes your library, favourites, Wii U keys, accounts, theme or premium unlock.\n\nImport settings reads such a file, checks it, and asks before it replaces anything. Importing replaces all your settings and every game's own options with what the file holds, and anything the file doesn't mention goes back to its default. Some changes apply the next time you start a game." = "「匯出所有設定」會將一個 .json 檔案寫入「檔案」：包含每項設定，以及你為個別遊戲設定的項目。其中絕不包含你的遊戲庫、最愛、Wii U 金鑰、帳號、主題或 Premium 解鎖。\n\n「匯入設定」會讀取這類檔案、進行檢查，並在取代任何內容之前詢問。匯入會用檔案中的內容取代你所有的設定和每個遊戲的專屬選項，檔案中未提及的項目則恢復為預設值。部分變更會在你下次啟動遊戲時生效。";
"Export cancelled." = "匯出已取消。";
"Export colours (.muffinclr)" = "匯出顏色 (.muffinclr)";
"Export everything" = "匯出全部";
"Export everything writes one file to Files, in MuffinEMU > Migration. It holds your saves, installed updates and DLC, accounts, keys.txt, otp.bin and seeprom.bin, compiled shader caches, graphic packs, save states, settings, favourites and appearance.\n\nGames (the Roms folder, and base games installed into the Wii U storage) are left out unless you turn on Include games. Without them the export is much smaller, and you can copy your games into the new app in Files. Screen recordings, save backups, logs and other caches are never included. The premium unlock isn't carried over; enter it again in the new app.\n\nThe export runs only while MuffinEMU is open on screen, and keeps the screen awake. You can stop it at any time. Before it starts, MuffinEMU checks that there's enough free space, and the file is kept out of device backups.\n\nWhen it's done, share the file to the new MuffinEMU's Files folder or to another device, install the new MuffinEMU, and choose Import from the old MuffinEMU there. Delete the export afterwards to get the space back." = "「匯出全部」會將一個檔案寫入「檔案」中的 MuffinEMU > Migration。其中包含你的存檔、已安裝的更新與 DLC、帳號、keys.txt、otp.bin 和 seeprom.bin、已編譯的著色器快取、圖形包、快速存檔、設定、最愛和外觀。\n\n遊戲（Roms 檔案夾，以及安裝到 Wii U 儲存空間的基本遊戲）除非開啟「包含遊戲」，否則不會包含在內。不含遊戲時，匯出檔小很多，你可以在「檔案」中將遊戲拷貝到新的 App。螢幕錄影、存檔備份、記錄和其他快取絕不會包含。Premium 解鎖不會轉移；請在新的 App 中重新輸入。\n\n匯出只會在 MuffinEMU 開啟並顯示於螢幕上時進行，並會讓螢幕保持喚醒。你可以隨時停止。開始之前，MuffinEMU 會檢查是否有足夠的可用空間，且該檔案不會納入裝置備份。\n\n完成後，請將檔案分享到新 MuffinEMU 的「檔案」檔案夾或其他裝置，安裝新的 MuffinEMU，並在那裡選擇「從舊版 MuffinEMU 匯入」。之後請刪除匯出檔以取回空間。";
