"Learned shaders are what a game has revealed by drawing with them. Importing adds them to this game's own file: anything the game already has stays as it is, and the file is never replaced.\n\nThe file has to be this game's: MuffinEMU checks the version stamp inside it, not the name. Desktop Cemu's files work: learned shaders are named like 000500001010ec00_shaders.bin and are converted the first time the game starts. MuffinEMU's are named ..._mtlshaders.bin. Desktop caches from before Cemu 1.16 use another format and can't be converted.\n\nPipeline caches are named ..._vkpipeline.bin (desktop Cemu, Vulkan) or ..._mtlpipeline.bin (MuffinEMU, Metal). A Vulkan one only helps the Vulkan renderer and a Metal one only the Metal renderer; it's stored either way and used when you switch. Each also needs the game's learned shaders. Import with the game closed. The sizes in Settings update the next time you open it." = "已學習的著色器是遊戲在用它們繪圖時顯露出來的內容。匯入會將它們加入此遊戲自己的檔案：遊戲已有的內容保持不變，檔案也絕不會被取代。\n\n檔案必須是此遊戲的：MuffinEMU 檢查的是檔案內的版本戳記，而不是名稱。桌面版 Cemu 的檔案可以使用：已學習的著色器命名如 000500001010ec00_shaders.bin，會在遊戲第一次啟動時轉換。MuffinEMU 的命名為 ..._mtlshaders.bin。早於 Cemu 1.16 的桌面版快取使用另一種格式，無法轉換。\n\n管線快取命名為 ..._vkpipeline.bin（桌面版 Cemu，Vulkan）或 ..._mtlpipeline.bin（MuffinEMU，Metal）。Vulkan 的只對 Vulkan 轉譯器有幫助，Metal 的只對 Metal 轉譯器有幫助；無論哪種都會儲存，並在你切換時使用。兩者也都需要遊戲已學習的著色器。請在遊戲關閉時匯入。「設定」中的大小會在你下次開啟時更新。";
