"MoltenVK is the layer that turns Vulkan into Metal, so it only matters with the Vulkan renderer. 1.4.3 is the default; 1.2.8 is an older build that some games run better on. A change applies the next time MuffinEMU starts." = "MoltenVK 是將 Vulkan 轉換為 Metal 的層，因此只對 Vulkan 轉譯器有影響。1.4.3 是預設版本；1.2.8 是較舊的版本，部分遊戲在上面執行得更好。變更會在 MuffinEMU 下次啟動時套用。";
