"MuffinEMU downloads GameTDB's Wii U database (about 2 MB), reads it one entry at a time and keeps only your games' entries, so the saved file stays small.\n\nEach game is matched in this order: its exact GameTDB ID worked out from the title ID, then its product code, then its title in any language, always preferring the entry for the game's own region. Every match records how sure it is, and each game's Info screen lets you pick a different entry if one is wrong.\n\nIt also runs by itself in the background for new games. Everything is stored per install, so two copies of one game can match differently." = "MuffinEMU 會下載 GameTDB 的 Wii U 資料庫（約 2 MB），逐項讀取，只保留你遊戲的項目，因此儲存的檔案很小。\n\n每個遊戲依此順序對應：先由標題 ID 推算出的確切 GameTDB ID，然後是產品代碼，接著是任何語言的標題，並一律優先選擇遊戲本身地區的項目。每次對應都會記錄把握程度，如果有錯，每個遊戲的「資訊」畫面都可讓你改選其他項目。\n\n它也會在背景自動為新遊戲執行。所有內容都依每個安裝儲存，因此同一個遊戲的兩份拷貝可能對應到不同結果。";
"MuffinEMU has to be closed and reopened before it can start another game." = "必須先關閉 MuffinEMU 並重新開啟，才能啟動另一個遊戲。";
"MuffinEMU is built on Cemu, and its core includes code from MeloCafe by stossy11." = "MuffinEMU 建立在 Cemu 之上，其核心包含來自 stossy11 的 MeloCafe 的程式碼。";
"MuffinEMU is built on Cemu, and its core includes code from MeloCafe by stossy11. The optional Melo-Controller pad is also by stossy11." = "MuffinEMU 建立在 Cemu 之上，其核心包含來自 stossy11 的 MeloCafe 的程式碼。選用的 Melo-Controller 面板也出自 stossy11。";
"MuffinEMU is moving to a new app identity, and the new one is a separate app that starts empty. This version stops getting updates after this release. Export your data here, install the new MuffinEMU, then import it there." = "MuffinEMU 正在轉移到新的 App 身分，新版是個獨立的 App，開始時是空的。此版本在這次發行後將不再獲得更新。請在此匯出你的資料，安裝新的 MuffinEMU，然後在那裡匯入。";
"MuffinEMU switches language the next time it opens." = "MuffinEMU 會在下次開啟時切換語言。";
