"Override the game's gamma and Override gamma are a separate stage from Display gamma above, not a second copy of it: some games ask for their own gamma value, and this either adds Override gamma on top of that request (off) or replaces the game's request with Override gamma entirely (on) - before Display gamma is applied to the result. Off by default; most games never ask for a specific gamma at all, so this has nothing to override until one does." = "「覆寫遊戲的 Gamma」和「覆寫 Gamma」是與上方「顯示器 Gamma」分開的階段，不是它的第二份拷貝：有些遊戲會要求自己的 Gamma 值，這項設定要不是（關閉時）在該要求之上再加上「覆寫 Gamma」，就是（開啟時）完全以「覆寫 Gamma」取代遊戲的要求——這都發生在對結果套用「顯示器 Gamma」之前。預設為關閉；大多數遊戲根本不會要求特定的 Gamma，因此在有遊戲要求之前沒有東西可覆寫。";
