"Pretendo is a community-run replacement for Nintendo's Wii U online services. Its server addresses are built in, so there's nothing to configure.\n\nNintendo's own servers have been shut down, so that option can't be selected.\n\nCustom works with a network_services.xml file. Add one under Custom servers above. It needs no linked account or otp.bin and seeprom.bin." = "Pretendo 是由社群營運、用來取代 Nintendo Wii U 線上服務的服務。其伺服器位址已內建，因此不需要設定。\n\nNintendo 自己的伺服器已關閉，因此該選項無法選取。\n\n「自訂」搭配 network_services.xml 檔案使用。請在上方的「自訂伺服器」下加入。它不需要已連結的帳號，也不需要 otp.bin 和 seeprom.bin。";
