"Save states are lost when the game or the app closes, including when iOS closes the app to free memory. For anything you want to keep, use the game's own save.\n\nSwipe a slot left, or press and hold it, to delete.\n\nA save state loads back only while the game keeps running from the launch it was saved in. After you quit or relaunch the game or the app, older saves stay in their slots but can't be loaded yet. Delete them, or save over them.\n\nAfter loading, some textures may briefly flash their old contents." = "遊戲或 App 關閉時快速存檔會遺失，包括 iOS 為釋出記憶體而關閉 App 的情況。需要保留的內容，請使用遊戲自己的存檔。\n\n將欄位向左滑動，或按住它，即可刪除。\n\n快速存檔只有在遊戲持續從儲存時的那次啟動執行時才能載回。結束或重新啟動遊戲或 App 後，較舊的存檔會留在欄位中，但暫時無法載入。請刪除它們，或覆寫儲存。\n\n載入後，部分紋理可能會短暫閃現舊的內容。";
