"Some games (Skylanders, Disney Infinity, LEGO Dimensions) read toy figures from a USB portal, base or toypad. Turn on the one your game uses; it applies the next time you start a game.\n\nManage Figures lets you load a figure dump you own, create a new save for a figure, or clear a slot. No figure data is included with MuffinEMU." = "部分遊戲（Skylanders、Disney Infinity、LEGO Dimensions）會從 USB 傳送門、底座或 Toypad 讀取玩具角色。請開啟你的遊戲所使用的那一個；會在你下次啟動遊戲時生效。\n\n「管理角色」可讓你載入你擁有的角色備份、為角色建立新的存檔，或清除欄位。MuffinEMU 不含任何角色資料。";
