"Switches which Wii U screen is shown." = "切換顯示哪個 Wii U 螢幕。";
"System" = "系統";
"TV and GamePad audio are separate tracks with their own on/off, volume and channel layout.\n\nChannels: Mono mixes everything to one channel, Stereo splits left and right (default), Surround asks the game for more channels; most games only use stereo. Turning TV or GamePad audio on or off, and changing channels, applies the next time you start a game.\n\nGamePad audio plays whatever the game sends to the GamePad speaker. Many games send nothing different from the TV mix.\n\nUse microphone feeds your device's real microphone to games that ask for the GamePad mic, while the game has the mic open. iOS asks for permission the first time you turn it on; if you say no, it switches back off. While it's on, the in-game Blow button is hidden. When it's off, games still see a GamePad mic, but it only hears the Blow button (a simulated puff of air) and iOS never asks for permission. Microphone volume (50 is normal, 100 is twice as loud) applies the next time a game opens the mic." = "電視與 GamePad 音訊是分開的音軌，各有自己的開關、音量和聲道配置。\n\n聲道：「單聲道」將所有聲音混成一個聲道，「立體聲」分成左右（預設），「環繞聲」向遊戲要求更多聲道；大多數遊戲只使用立體聲。開啟或關閉電視或 GamePad 音訊，以及變更聲道，會在你下次啟動遊戲時生效。\n\nGamePad 音訊會播放遊戲傳給 GamePad 喇叭的任何內容。許多遊戲傳送的與電視混音沒有差別。\n\n「使用麥克風」會在遊戲開啟麥克風期間，將你裝置的真實麥克風提供給要求 GamePad 麥克風的遊戲。第一次開啟時，iOS 會要求權限；如果你選擇不允許，它會切換回關閉。開啟時，遊戲中的「吹氣」按鈕會隱藏。關閉時，遊戲仍會看到 GamePad 麥克風，但它只聽得到「吹氣」按鈕（模擬的一口氣），而且 iOS 絕不會要求權限。「麥克風音量」（50 為正常，100 為兩倍大聲）會在遊戲下次開啟麥克風時套用。";
"TV and GamePad audio have their own volume and channel layout. GamePad audio plays through this device's speaker or headphones. Use the microphone to give games your real voice and sounds through the GamePad mic; otherwise the in-game Blow button covers games that ask you to blow." = "電視與 GamePad 音訊各有自己的音量和聲道配置。GamePad 音訊會透過此裝置的喇叭或耳機播放。使用麥克風可透過 GamePad 麥克風將你真實的聲音傳給遊戲；否則，遊戲中的「吹氣」按鈕可應付要求你吹氣的遊戲。";
"TV and GamePad sound, the microphone and recording." = "電視與 GamePad 聲音、麥克風和錄製。";
"TV audio" = "電視音訊";
"TV channels" = "電視聲道";
"TV screen" = "電視螢幕";
"TV volume" = "電視音量";
"Taiwan" = "台灣";
"Takes it out of the library. It stays installed; turn this off to bring it back." = "將它從遊戲庫移除。它仍保持安裝；關閉此項即可找回。";
"Takes the way you are holding the device now as straight ahead, then goes back to the game." = "將你目前握持裝置的方式視為正前方，然後返回遊戲。";
"Tap Import a Game, or put game files in Files > On My iPad > MuffinEMU > Roms." = "點一下「匯入遊戲」，或將遊戲檔案放入「檔案」>「在我的 iPad 上」> MuffinEMU > Roms。";
"Tap Quit Game and reopen MuffinEMU. After you quit, a lower Resolution (in Settings, Graphics) uses less memory." = "點一下「結束遊戲」並重新開啟 MuffinEMU。結束後，較低的解析度（在「設定」的「圖形」中）會使用較少記憶體。";
"Tap a button to pick it, then drag it to move it, pinch it or use Size to resize it. It stops where it would touch another button or leave the screen." = "點一下按鈕即可選取，然後拖移來移動，或用兩指縮放、使用「大小」來調整。它會在即將碰到其他按鈕或離開螢幕之處停止。";
"Tap a button to pick its whole group (the d-pad, the face buttons, a stick, a pair of shoulder buttons, or plus, minus and HOME), then drag or pinch it as one." = "點一下按鈕即可選取其整組（方向鍵、動作按鈕、搖桿、一對肩鍵，或加號、減號和 HOME），然後整組拖移或縮放。";
"Tap a game to" = "點一下遊戲以";
"Tap a server to make it the active Custom server, then pick Custom under Network Service. Swipe to delete." = "點一下伺服器即可設為使用中的自訂伺服器，然後在「網路服務」下選擇「自訂」。滑動可刪除。";
"Tap the GamePad screen to use it in the game." = "點一下 GamePad 螢幕即可在遊戲中使用。";
"Tap the heart on a game to add it here." = "點一下遊戲上的愛心即可加到這裡。";
"Tap the top edge to bring the bar back." = "點一下頂端邊緣即可讓列重新出現。";
"Tap to resume" = "點一下以繼續";
"Tap to skip" = "點一下以略過";
"Test" = "測試";
"Test it now" = "立即測試";
"Text size" = "文字大小";
"That ID is already used by account %@." = "該 ID 已被帳號 %@ 使用。";
"That code didn't work." = "該代碼無效。";
"That doesn't look like a valid image." = "這看起來不是有效的圖片。";
"That file couldn't be read." = "無法讀取該檔案。";
"That file has no settings MuffinEMU can use." = "該檔案中沒有 MuffinEMU 可以使用的設定。";
"That file is corrupted or incomplete." = "該檔案已損毀或不完整。";
"That file is far too big to be a keys.txt." = "該檔案太大，不可能是 keys.txt。";
"That file is from a newer MuffinEMU (settings file version %d). Update the app, then try again." = "該檔案來自較新版本的 MuffinEMU（設定檔版本 %d）。請更新 App，然後再試一次。";
"That file is too big to be an amiibo dump (they are about 540 bytes)." = "該檔案太大，不是 amiibo 備份（約 540 位元組）。";
"That file isn't readable text - keys.txt is a plain text file with one key per line." = "該檔案不是可讀取的文字 - keys.txt 是純文字檔，每行一個金鑰。";
"That file was made by a newer MuffinEMU (move file version %d). Update the app, then try again." = "該檔案是由較新版本的 MuffinEMU 製作（移轉檔案版本 %d）。請更新 App，然後再試一次。";
"That folder doesn't look like a Wii U save. Pick the folder named after the game's title ID, or the 'user' folder inside it." = "該檔案夾看起來不是 Wii U 存檔。請選取以遊戲標題 ID 命名的檔案夾，或其中的 'user' 檔案夾。";
"That image couldn't be saved in a supported format." = "該圖片無法以支援的格式儲存。";
"That isn't a MuffinEMU move file." = "這不是 MuffinEMU 移轉檔案。";
"That isn't a MuffinEMU settings file." = "這不是 MuffinEMU 設定檔。";
"That isn't a usable network_services.xml. It needs a <content> element with a <urls> list of web addresses." = "這不是可用的 network_services.xml。它需要有 <content> 元素，其中含有網址的 <urls> 清單。";
"That link isn't valid." = "該連結無效。";
"That one didn't cover enough of the ring. Try again." = "該次沒有涵蓋足夠的環。請再試一次。";
"That title folder isn't a Wii U Menu (title id %@). The Menu is 0005001010040000, 0005001010040100 or 0005001010040200." = "該標題檔案夾不是 Wii U Menu（標題 ID %@）。Menu 是 0005001010040000、0005001010040100 或 0005001010040200。";
"The %@ link isn't valid. Check it in Settings, under JIT enabler." = "%@ 連結無效。請在「設定」的 JIT 啟用器下檢查。";
"The .wua doesn't contain a matching update or DLC for this game." = "此 .wua 不含此遊戲相符的更新或 DLC。";
"The .wua file couldn't be read. It may be corrupted." = "無法讀取 .wua 檔案。可能已損毀。";
"The 3D box template behind MuffinEMU's no-cover images." = "MuffinEMU 無封面圖片所用的 3D 盒裝樣板。";
"The Accuracy profile runs this game on one core whatever this says." = "無論此處設定為何，「準確度」設定檔都會以單一核心執行此遊戲。";
"The Battery saver profile runs this game on one core whatever this says." = "無論此處設定為何，「省電」設定檔都會以單一核心執行此遊戲。";
"The CPU line shows what this launch got: the recompiler (JIT), which is the fast way, or the interpreter, which is much slower. The recompiler needs a JIT enabler (StikJIT, SideStore or LiveContainer); both are set under JIT.\n\nCPU cores (Advanced mode) picks how many cores run a game. Auto decides for each game and device. The Accuracy and Battery saver performance profiles run on one core whatever this says.\n\nMemory shows how much the recompiler reserved. If it couldn't reserve any, the interpreter runs instead.\n\nCPU cores applies the next time you start a game." = "CPU 那一行顯示此次啟動得到的結果：重新編譯器 (JIT)，也就是快速的方式，或直譯器，慢很多。重新編譯器需要 JIT 啟用器（StikJIT、SideStore 或 LiveContainer）；兩者都在 JIT 下設定。\n\n「CPU 核心」（進階模式）選擇用多少個核心執行遊戲。「自動」會依每個遊戲和裝置決定。「準確度」和「省電」效能設定檔無論此處設定為何，都使用單一核心。\n\n「記憶體」顯示重新編譯器保留了多少。如果完全無法保留，則改為執行直譯器。\n\n「CPU 核心」會在你下次啟動遊戲時生效。";
"The FPS and usage readout over the game: what it lists, and where." = "遊戲上方的 FPS 和使用量讀數：列出哪些內容，以及位置。";
"The GamePad at its real size and proportions, clean and sleek. Native keeps the picture clear; Fit wraps the pad around it." = "GamePad 以真實大小和比例呈現，簡潔俐落。「原生」讓畫面保持清晰；「適應」則讓面板包覆畫面。";
"The GamePad has no button bindings, so presses go nowhere while sticks still work. Settings > On-screen Controls > Reset controller bindings." = "GamePad 沒有按鈕綁定，因此按下去不會有任何反應，但搖桿仍可運作。請至「設定」>「螢幕控制」>「重置控制器綁定」。";
"The GamePad layout, but each group of buttons slowly moves to where your thumbs actually press." = "GamePad 版面，但每組按鈕會慢慢移到你拇指實際按壓的位置。";
"The GamePad's own layout with forgiving, gap-free touch zones, slide between buttons and two-button presses." = "GamePad 本身的版面，具有寬容且無縫隙的觸控區域、可在按鈕之間滑動，以及雙按鈕同按。";
"The GameTDB database couldn't be read." = "無法讀取 GameTDB 資料庫。";
"The GameTDB download didn't contain wiiutdb.xml." = "GameTDB 下載內容中不含 wiiutdb.xml。";
"The Network Service can't be changed while a game is running. Close the game first." = "遊戲執行期間無法變更網路服務。請先關閉遊戲。";
"The Speed performance profile is on (Performance, at the top of this page), so the picture is drawn at Balanced at most, with linear scaling." = "「速度」效能設定檔已開啟（效能，在此頁面頂端），因此畫面最多以「平衡」繪製，並採用線性縮放。";
"The Speed profile is on for this game, so the picture is drawn at Balanced at most, with linear scaling." = "此遊戲已開啟「速度」設定檔，因此畫面最多以「平衡」繪製，並採用線性縮放。";
"The Wii U Menu and its system files." = "Wii U Menu 及其系統檔案。";
"The Wii U Menu may not start" = "Wii U Menu 可能無法啟動";
"The Wii U Menu was removed. Your saves and games weren't touched." = "Wii U Menu 已移除。你的存檔和遊戲未被動到。";
"The Wii U has two screens: the TV and the GamePad.\n\nScreen Layout: Single Screen shows one at a time with a swap button; Adaptive shows both, stacked in portrait and side by side in landscape; Both Screens (GamePad Top Right) keeps the TV full size with a small GamePad inset.\n\nWith Single Screen, Pause the TV screen and Pause the GamePad screen stop drawing whichever screen is out of sight, to save heat and battery. The game keeps running. They are under Performance too.\n\nStretch picture to fill the screen fills the screen's own shape instead of keeping the Wii U's 1280x720 proportions, which otherwise letterboxes with bars on two sides. Off keeps the picture undistorted; on trades that for using every pixel. Takes effect on the very next frame.\n\nFlip screen upside down (Advanced mode) turns both Wii U screens vertically before they reach the screen. Off for everyone except a panel or capture rig that presents the image inverted.\n\nAllow portrait during games (iPhone): hold the phone upright and the picture goes along the top with the controls below it. Menus stay in landscape. Turn it off if you'd rather a game never turns when the phone tilts; the iOS rotation lock works too." = "Wii U 有兩個螢幕：電視和 GamePad。\n\n螢幕版面：「單一螢幕」一次顯示一個，並附切換按鈕；「自適應」顯示兩個，直式時上下堆疊，橫式時左右並排；「雙螢幕（GamePad 在右上）」讓電視維持完整大小，並在角落嵌入小型 GamePad。\n\n在「單一螢幕」下，「電視螢幕暫停」和「GamePad 螢幕暫停」會停止繪製看不見的那個螢幕，以節省發熱和電量。遊戲持續執行。它們也在「效能」下。\n\n「拉伸畫面以填滿螢幕」會填滿螢幕本身的形狀，而不是維持 Wii U 的 1280x720 比例（否則兩側會出現黑邊）。關閉時畫面不會變形；開啟則以此換取使用每一個像素。於下一個影格即生效。\n\n「上下翻轉螢幕」（進階模式）會在兩個 Wii U 螢幕送到畫面之前將它們垂直翻轉。除非是以反向呈現影像的面板或擷取設備，否則請保持關閉。\n\n「遊戲中允許直式」（iPhone）：直立握持手機，畫面在上方，控制項在下方。選單維持橫式。如果你希望遊戲不會因手機傾斜而旋轉，請關閉；iOS 的旋轉鎖定也有效。";
"The area you tap to bring the bar back. Large is easier to hit, but it can take touches meant for the GamePad screen at the top of the picture." = "你點按以讓列重新出現的區域。「大」比較容易按到，但可能會吃掉原本要給畫面頂端 GamePad 螢幕的觸控。";
"The art pack list couldn't be loaded. Check your connection and try again." = "無法載入美術包清單。請檢查你的連線，然後再試一次。";
"The bar fades away a few seconds after you last touch it. Tap the small handle at the top of the screen, or swipe down from it, to bring it back. It stays up while paused, in menus, and with VoiceOver on. On by default." = "最後一次觸碰後數秒，列會淡出。點一下螢幕頂端的小把手，或從它向下滑動，即可讓它重新出現。暫停時、在選單中，以及開啟旁白時，它會保持顯示。預設為開啟。";
"The community packs are downloaded from the Cemu graphic packs project's latest release on GitHub. The download is verified (size and a checksum on every file) before it replaces anything, and it needs free space for the zip and the extracted copy. If it fails or is cancelled, the packs you already have stay as they were.\n\nMuffinEMU checks for a newer release when you open this screen, at most once a day, or when you tap Check for updates. Pack choices (which packs are on and their options) are kept across updates.\n\nThe download keeps going if you leave the app." = "社群套件包是從 GitHub 上 Cemu 圖形包專案的最新發行版下載。下載內容在取代任何東西之前會先驗證（大小和每個檔案的校驗碼），且需要有足夠空間容納 zip 和解壓縮後的拷貝。如果失敗或取消，你已有的套件包會維持原樣。\n\n當你開啟此畫面時，MuffinEMU 會檢查是否有較新的發行版，每天最多一次，或在你點「檢查更新」時檢查。套件包的選擇（開啟哪些套件包及其選項）會在更新後保留。\n\n即使你離開 App，下載也會繼續。";
"The community packs are made by the Cemu graphic packs project and its contributors." = "社群套件包是由 Cemu 圖形包專案及其貢獻者製作。";
"The community packs don't include one for %@. You can still import your own below." = "社群套件包中沒有 %@ 的套件包。你仍然可以在下方匯入自己的。";
"The console will appear connected." = "主機會顯示為已連線。";
"The console will appear offline." = "主機會顯示為離線。";
"The controls come back when it disconnects. The GamePad's screen stays, so you can still touch it." = "控制器中斷連接時，控制項會回來。GamePad 的螢幕會保留，因此你仍可觸控。";
"The controls disappear while the home menu is open and come back when it closes." = "HOME 選單開啟時控制項會消失，關閉時再回來。";
"The controls fade almost out after a few seconds without a touch, and come straight back under your thumb." = "幾秒沒有觸碰後，控制項會幾乎完全淡出，並在你的拇指下立即回來。";
"The defaults suit most games, so change one thing at a time. Performance profile, at the top, is the quickest way to trade speed against accuracy or battery. A single game can have its own values: open it in the library, then Game settings." = "預設值適合大多數遊戲，所以一次只改一件事。最上方的「效能設定檔」是在速度與準確度或電量之間取捨最快的方法。單一遊戲可以有自己的值：在遊戲庫中開啟它，然後選「遊戲設定」。";
"The device has cooled down. The game should run at full speed again." = "裝置已降溫。遊戲應可恢復全速執行。";
"The device has cooled down. The picture is back to normal." = "裝置已降溫。畫面已恢復正常。";
"The device is hot, so MuffinEMU made the picture softer to keep the game running. It goes back when the device cools." = "裝置很燙，因此 MuffinEMU 讓畫面變模糊以維持遊戲執行。裝置降溫後會恢復。";
"The device is hot, so iOS is slowing the game down. After you quit, try Cool down automatically (Settings, CPU) or a lower Resolution (Settings, Graphics)." = "裝置很燙，所以 iOS 正在降低遊戲速度。結束後，請試試「自動降溫」（「設定」，CPU）或較低的解析度（「設定」，圖形）。";
"The download failed (%@)." = "下載失敗（%@）。";
"The download finished but couldn't be saved: %@" = "下載完成但無法儲存：%@";
"The download of %@ didn't match its checksum, so it was thrown away. Try again." = "%@ 的下載內容與其校驗碼不符，因此已丟棄。請再試一次。";
"The download server answered with error %d." = "下載伺服器回應錯誤 %d。";
"The downloadable packs are the Cemu graphic packs project's community collection (github.com/cemu-project/cemu_graphic_packs), made and maintained by its many contributors and released under the CC0 1.0 public domain dedication. MuffinEMU downloads them straight from that project's releases and doesn't change them.\n\nPacks that replace shaders are written for OpenGL and Vulkan. The Metal renderer can't use those shaders, so such packs are marked. Packs made only of settings, presets and patches work with Metal." = "可下載的套件包是 Cemu 圖形包專案的社群集合 (github.com/cemu-project/cemu_graphic_packs)，由眾多貢獻者製作並維護，以 CC0 1.0 公有領域貢獻宣告釋出。MuffinEMU 直接從該專案的發行版下載，並不會變更它們。\n\n取代著色器的套件包是為 OpenGL 和 Vulkan 撰寫的。Metal 轉譯器無法使用那些著色器，因此這類套件包會加上標記。僅由設定、預設組合和修補程式組成的套件包可在 Metal 上運作。";
"The drive or folder this game is stored on was disconnected. Connect it again, go back and start the game again." = "此遊戲所儲存的磁碟機或檔案夾已中斷連接。請重新連接，返回後再次啟動遊戲。";
"The emulated console's clock speed." = "模擬主機的時脈速度。";
"The engine didn't report a reason." = "引擎未回報原因。";
"The experimental new pad is active. If controls don't respond, turn off Use the new pad system in Settings > On-screen Controls > New pad system (preview)." = "實驗性的新搖桿面板已啟用。如果控制項沒有反應，請在「設定」>「螢幕控制」>「新搖桿面板系統（預覽版）」中關閉「使用新搖桿面板系統」。";
"The external display is off by default; turn it on before connecting a display. Then choose which Wii U screen it shows, and what this device shows next to it: the other screen, the same screen, or only the controls. It is experimental and hasn't been tested on much hardware.\n\nThe HOME menu has the same settings during a game." = "外接顯示器預設為關閉；請在連接顯示器之前開啟。然後選擇它顯示哪個 Wii U 螢幕，以及此裝置在旁邊顯示什麼：另一個螢幕、同一個螢幕，或僅控制項。這是實驗性功能，尚未在多種硬體上測試。\n\n遊戲期間 HOME 選單中有相同的設定。";
"The external display shows the %@ and this device shows the %@." = "外接顯示器顯示%@，此裝置顯示%@。";
"The external display shows the %@. This device shows only the on-screen controls on black." = "外接顯示器顯示%@。此裝置只在黑色背景上顯示螢幕控制。";
"The fast way to run games. Needs a JIT enabler; without one the slow interpreter runs instead." = "執行遊戲的快速方式。需要 JIT 啟用器；沒有的話會改為執行緩慢的直譯器。";
"The file isn't a valid zip archive." = "該檔案不是有效的 zip 封存檔。";
"The file you picked wasn't changed." = "你選取的檔案未變更。";
"The game is still running but the screen isn't taking frames. This goes away by itself if it recovers. If it doesn't, tap Quit Game and reopen MuffinEMU." = "遊戲仍在執行，但螢幕沒有接收影格。如果恢復，這會自行消失。如果沒有，請點一下「結束遊戲」並重新開啟 MuffinEMU。";
"The game itself and your saves are not touched." = "遊戲本身和你的存檔不會被動到。";
"The game stopped. Go back and try it again. If it keeps happening, close and reopen MuffinEMU." = "遊戲已停止。請返回並再試一次。如果持續發生，請關閉並重新開啟 MuffinEMU。";
"The game stutters while it relearns its shaders." = "遊戲在重新學習著色器期間會卡頓。";
"The game waits while you move or adjust the on-screen controls, and carries on when you tap Done." = "你移動或調整螢幕控制時，遊戲會等待，點一下「完成」後繼續。";
"The images are removed from this device. You can download %@ again later." = "圖片會從此裝置移除。你之後可以再次下載 %@。";
"The intro plays during the boot. If you turn on the launch log it takes the screen instead, so you can see timestamped boot steps when a game starts but stays black." = "片頭會在開機期間播放。如果你開啟啟動記錄，它會改為佔用螢幕，讓你在遊戲啟動但畫面維持黑色時，看到帶有時間戳記的開機步驟。";
"The intro plays while a game starts." = "片頭會在遊戲啟動時播放。";
"The keys.txt encrypted games need." = "加密的遊戲所需的 keys.txt。";
"The language MuffinEMU's menus are in." = "MuffinEMU 選單使用的語言。";
"The latest release doesn't have a download MuffinEMU can use." = "最新的發行版沒有 MuffinEMU 可以使用的下載內容。";
"The latest release is a different size than graphic packs should be." = "最新的發行版大小與圖形包應有的大小不同。";
"The launch intro, launch log and controls diagnostic." = "啟動片頭、啟動記錄和控制診斷。";
"The launch log shows boot progress and replaces the intro while it's on." = "啟動記錄會顯示開機進度，並在開啟時取代片頭。";
"The layout from a 12.9-inch iPad Pro, fitted to your screen." = "來自 12.9 吋 iPad Pro 的版面，已調整為符合你的螢幕。";
"The least the game is sent once you are past the inner deadzone. For games that have a deadzone of their own and ignore small pushes." = "一旦超過內側死區，傳送給遊戲的最小值。適用於有自己死區且會忽略小幅度推動的遊戲。";
"The link needs {bundleId} in it, and has to be a valid URL." = "連結中必須包含 {bundleId}，且必須是有效的 URL。";
"The list holds the control style, Add analog sticks and the resets. Size and feel (button size, opacity, haptics and, on iPad, shoulder height), Stick tuning and During play (the top bar and when the controls hide) are pages of their own.\n\nAdd analog sticks puts both sticks on screen alongside the d-pad and face buttons. Push further for more speed.\n\nGate is the shape the stick can reach. Octagon matches the real GamePad; Round reaches full travel in every direction.\n\nCalibrate sticks has you rest your thumb, push to every edge and let go, then sets where full push is and ignores the wobble of your resting thumb. It applies to every control style.\n\nDeadzone is how far you can move before the game notices. Turn it up only if a resting thumb makes the game drift.\n\nFine control makes small movements gentler: at linear, halfway is half speed; higher values make halfway slower.\n\nIn Advanced mode, Stick fine-tuning sets each stick on its own: inner deadzone, outer deadzone (where full push is reached), anti-deadzone (the least the game is sent once past the deadzone, for games with their own), fine control, horizontal and vertical sensitivity, and invert. Its test circle shows what the game is sent. It is also in the move-controls panel in a game. The Deadzone and Fine control sliders set both sticks.\n\nStick spacing moves both sticks closer together or further apart, for smaller or bigger hands. On a narrow screen it stops before the sticks would touch.\n\nOn iPad, L, R, ZL and ZR height moves the four shoulder buttons up or down together, stopping before they would leave the screen or touch a stick or button.\n\nButton size and opacity adjust the size MuffinEMU picks for your screen.\n\nHide the top bar while playing fades the Back and pause bar out a few seconds after you last touch it, so it stops covering the picture. A small handle stays at the top centre of the screen: tap it, or swipe down from it, to bring the bar back. The bar stays up while the game is paused, a menu is open, or VoiceOver is on.\n\nIn Advanced mode, Top bar hides after sets the wait (2, 4 or 8 seconds) and Reveal handle sets the size of the area you tap to bring the bar back. Normal is the default; Large is easier to hit but can take touches meant for the GamePad screen at the top of the picture.\n\nHide on-screen controls when a controller is connected takes the controls off the screen while a controller is paired, and puts them back when it disconnects. It is off by default. The GamePad's screen stays visible and touchable either way.\n\nThese settings apply to every game. Two things are kept per game instead: Adaptive remembers where your thumbs land, and Melo-Controller remembers where you moved its buttons.\n\nTo move a cluster, start a game and tap the move button in the top bar. There you can also switch control style without leaving the game." = "清單包含控制樣式、「加入類比搖桿」和重置。「大小與手感」（按鈕大小、不透明度、觸覺回饋，在 iPad 上還有肩鍵高度）、「搖桿調整」和「遊玩期間」（頂端列以及控制項何時隱藏）各自是獨立的頁面。\n\n「加入類比搖桿」會將兩支搖桿與方向鍵和動作按鈕並列顯示在螢幕上。推得越遠速度越快。\n\n「邊框」是搖桿能到達的形狀。「八角形」與真實 GamePad 相符；「圓形」在每個方向都能達到完整行程。\n\n「校正搖桿」會讓你放鬆拇指、往每個邊緣推，然後放開，接著設定完整推動的位置，並忽略你放鬆拇指時的晃動。適用於所有控制樣式。\n\n「死區」是遊戲察覺之前你可以移動的距離。只有在拇指停著遊戲卻會漂移時才調高。\n\n「精細控制」讓小幅度的移動更柔和：在線性時，推到一半就是一半速度；數值越高，推到一半越慢。\n\n在進階模式下，「搖桿微調」可個別設定每支搖桿：內側死區、外側死區（達到完整推動之處）、反死區（超過死區後傳送給遊戲的最小值，適用於有自己死區的遊戲）、精細控制、水平和垂直靈敏度，以及反轉。其測試圓圈會顯示傳送給遊戲的值。遊戲中的移動控制項面板也有。「死區」和「精細控制」滑桿會同時設定兩支搖桿。\n\n「搖桿間距」讓兩支搖桿靠近或拉遠，適合較小或較大的手。在窄螢幕上，它會在搖桿即將碰到之前停止。\n\n在 iPad 上，「L、R、ZL 和 ZR 高度」會同時上下移動四個肩鍵，在即將離開螢幕或碰到搖桿或按鈕之前停止。\n\n「按鈕大小」和「不透明度」會調整 MuffinEMU 為你的螢幕選定的大小。\n\n「遊玩時隱藏頂端列」會在你最後一次觸碰數秒後淡出「返回」和暫停列，使它不再遮住畫面。螢幕頂端中央會保留一個小把手：點一下它，或從它向下滑動，即可讓列重新出現。遊戲暫停、選單開啟或旁白開啟時，列會保持顯示。\n\n在進階模式下，「頂端列隱藏時間」設定等待時間（2、4 或 8 秒），「顯示把手」設定你點按以讓列重新出現的區域大小。「一般」是預設值；「大」比較容易按到，但可能會吃掉原本要給畫面頂端 GamePad 螢幕的觸控。\n\n「連接控制器時隱藏螢幕控制」會在控制器配對時將控制項從螢幕上移除，並在中斷連接時放回來。預設為關閉。GamePad 的螢幕無論如何都保持可見且可觸控。\n\n這些設定適用於所有遊戲。有兩項改為依遊戲保存：「自適應」會記住你拇指落下的位置，而 Melo-Controller 會記住你移動其按鈕的位置。\n\n若要移動一組，請啟動遊戲並點一下頂端列的移動按鈕。在那裡也可以不離開遊戲就切換控制樣式。";
"The match is for this install only. Another copy of the same game can match differently." = "此對應僅限於這次安裝。同一個遊戲的另一份拷貝可能對應到不同結果。";
"The move file is damaged (%@). Nothing in it was trusted past that point." = "移轉檔案已損毀（%@）。超過該點之後的任何內容都不予採信。";
"The next launch of each game is slow once." = "每個遊戲下次啟動時會慢一次。";
"The next start of this game is slow once." = "此遊戲下次啟動時會慢一次。";
"The normal balance of speed and picture quality." = "速度與畫質的正常平衡。";
"The old account %@ was saved as %@." = "舊帳號 %@ 已儲存為 %@。";
"The on-screen pad can add analog sticks and comfort controls, and any MFi, Xbox, or PlayStation controller works right alongside it." = "螢幕搖桿面板可加入類比搖桿和舒適控制，任何 MFi、Xbox 或 PlayStation 控制器也都可與它並用。";
"The on-screen pad, motion aiming and figure portals." = "螢幕搖桿面板、動作瞄準和角色傳送門。";
"The original is never changed." = "原始檔案絕不會被變更。";
"The other screen" = "另一個螢幕";
"The overlay is the engine's own readout. Position picks a corner of the TV screen; Off hides it, and the other rows stay dimmed until a corner is chosen.\n\nFPS is the frame rate the game is producing. CPU, per-core CPU, RAM and VRAM usage measure MuffinEMU itself, not the whole device. Draw calls counts draw commands in the current frame. Debug info adds a few lines of renderer state.\n\nThe panel only appears while at least one of FPS, draw calls, CPU, per-core CPU or RAM is on. VRAM usage and debug info are extra lines inside it, so on their own they show nothing.\n\nText size and colour change the readout's look. Changes show up straight away." = "疊層是引擎本身的讀數。「位置」選擇電視螢幕的一個角落；「關閉」會將它隱藏，在選擇角落之前，其他列會保持變暗。\n\nFPS 是遊戲產生的畫面更新率。CPU、各核心 CPU、RAM 和 VRAM 使用量測量的是 MuffinEMU 本身，而不是整部裝置。「繪製呼叫」計算目前影格中的繪製指令。「除錯資訊」會增加幾行轉譯器狀態。\n\n只有在 FPS、繪製呼叫、CPU、各核心 CPU 或 RAM 至少開啟一項時，面板才會出現。VRAM 使用量和除錯資訊是其中的額外行，所以單獨開啟時不會顯示任何東西。\n\n「文字大小」和顏色會改變讀數的外觀。變更立即顯示。";
"The pack unpacked, but no images were found in it." = "套件包已解開，但其中找不到任何圖片。";
"The pack's download address is invalid." = "該套件包的下載位址無效。";
"The performance profile, Steady frame rate, pausing a hidden screen, and cooling down." = "效能設定檔、穩定畫面更新率、暫停隱藏的螢幕，以及降溫。";
"The persistent ID must be %@ or higher." = "持續性 ID 必須為 %@ 或更高。";
"The persistent ID must be hexadecimal (0-9, A-F)." = "持續性 ID 必須是十六進位（0-9、A-F）。";
"The picture froze" = "畫面凍結了";
