"The polished look on every control style: hairline outlines, soft shadows, a lit rim and buttons that sink when pressed. Off keeps the flat look." = "每種控制樣式上的精緻外觀：極細輪廓、柔和陰影、發亮邊緣，以及按下時會下沉的按鈕。關閉則維持平面外觀。";
"The pro app icons are yours." = "專業版 App 圖示是你的了。";
"The pro app icons." = "專業版 App 圖示。";
"The profile applies the next time you start a game. Cool down automatically only acts when the device overheats; Battery saver is the always-on version." = "設定檔會在你下次啟動遊戲時生效。「自動降溫」只會在裝置過熱時動作；「省電」則是持續開啟的版本。";
"The recompiler, whether JIT is on, and the enabler that turns it on." = "重新編譯器、JIT 是否開啟，以及開啟它的啟用器。";
"The recording stopped because storage is almost full. What was recorded is saved in the Recordings folder." = "錄製已停止，因為儲存空間幾乎已滿。已錄製的內容儲存在 Recordings 檔案夾中。";
"The recording stopped because the video couldn't be written." = "錄製已停止，因為無法寫入影片。";
"The same screen as the TV" = "與電視相同的螢幕";
"The same title was added twice." = "同一個標題被加入了兩次。";
"The same version is already installed. Reinstalling replaces it. Save data is not touched." = "已安裝相同的版本。重新安裝會取代它。存檔資料不會被動到。";
"The save the game itself writes. Not a save state. Export is available once the game has saved." = "遊戲本身寫入的存檔。不是快速存檔。遊戲儲存過後才能匯出。";
"The saved copy is removed. If it's the active server, the active network_services.xml is removed too." = "已儲存的拷貝會被移除。如果它是使用中的伺服器，使用中的 network_services.xml 也會一併移除。";
"The screen stopped updating" = "螢幕停止更新";
"The skin applies to every game." = "外觀會套用到所有遊戲。";
"The slowest setting. If a game still won't move, the clock isn't the problem." = "最慢的設定。如果遊戲仍然動不了，問題就不在時脈。";
"The stick's centre is wherever your thumb lands in its zone, so the first touch is never a push." = "搖桿的中心是你拇指落在其區域內的任何位置，因此第一次觸碰絕不會算作推動。";
"The title list comes from GameTDB's database. Scrape once to download it." = "標題清單來自 GameTDB 的資料庫。擷取一次即可下載。";
"The top bar, and when the controls hide or pause the game." = "頂端列，以及控制項何時隱藏或暫停遊戲。";
"The touch pad: size, opacity, sticks and when it hides." = "觸控面板：大小、不透明度、搖桿，以及何時隱藏。";
"The update or DLC belongs to a different game." = "此更新或 DLC 屬於不同的遊戲。";
"The v2.0 look: flat cards, plain headers, system-font rows." = "v2.0 的外觀：平面卡片、純色標題、系統字體的列。";
"The zip contains a path outside its own folder (%@)." = "zip 中含有位於其自身檔案夾之外的路徑（%@）。";
"The zip couldn't be read." = "無法讀取該 zip。";
