"There's no VSync switch because iOS always syncs frames to the screen's own refresh, so the picture never tears and there is nothing to turn off. For even frame pacing, use Steady frame rate under Performance, at the top of this page." = "沒有垂直同步開關，因為 iOS 一律讓影格與螢幕本身的更新率同步，所以畫面不會撕裂，也沒有什麼好關閉的。若要讓影格節奏平均，請使用本頁頂端「效能」中的「穩定畫面更新率」。";
"There's no save for this game yet. Play it once, then export." = "此遊戲還沒有存檔。請先遊玩一次，然後再匯出。";
"These act when Screen Layout is Single Screen (Screen and sound > Display). Your layout shows both screens, so nothing is paused now." = "這些在「螢幕版面」為「單一螢幕」時動作（螢幕與聲音 >「顯示器」）。你的版面顯示兩個螢幕，因此現在沒有任何項目被暫停。";
"These are independent projects, listed for information. MuffinEMU doesn't host them, and there's no server address built in for them: import the network_services.xml their host gives you.\n\nPretendo Network is built in under Network Service, but it needs a Wii U's account and console files." = "這些是獨立的專案，僅供參考列出。MuffinEMU 不代管它們，也沒有為它們內建伺服器位址：請匯入其營運者提供給你的 network_services.xml。\n\nPretendo Network 內建於「網路服務」下，但它需要 Wii U 的帳號和主機檔案。";
"These settings apply to every game, except that Adaptive remembers where your thumbs land separately for each game." = "這些設定適用於所有遊戲，只有「自適應」會為每個遊戲分別記住你拇指落下的位置。";
"These settings apply to every game." = "這些設定適用於所有遊戲。";
"These styles don't support dragging individual buttons. " = "這些樣式不支援拖移個別按鈕。";
"This .wua holds more than the one update or DLC for this game. Use a .wua with just that content." = "此 .wua 包含的不只是此遊戲的一個更新或 DLC。請使用只含該內容的 .wua。";
"This Device" = "此裝置";
