"This app" = "此 App";
"This clears every game's shaders. Games will stutter while they rebuild them." = "這會清除所有遊戲的著色器。遊戲在重新建置期間會卡頓。";
"This comes from the graphics chip, memory and screen, not a speed test, so treat it as a starting point." = "這來自圖形晶片、記憶體和螢幕，而不是速度測試，所以請當作起點。";
