"This deletes \"%@\" from MuffinEMU to free up space. Your saves and options are kept. To play it again, add the game back." = "這會從 MuffinEMU 刪除「%@」以釋出空間。你的存檔和選項會保留。若要再次遊玩，請重新加入該遊戲。";
"This deletes the Wii U Menu from MuffinEMU's storage. Shared data, system apps, cafeLibs, otp.bin and seeprom.bin stay, since games can use them. Your saves and your games aren't touched. You can import the Menu again from Settings > Wii U Menu." = "這會從 MuffinEMU 的儲存空間刪除 Wii U Menu。共用資料、系統 App、cafeLibs、otp.bin 和 seeprom.bin 會保留，因為遊戲可能會用到。你的存檔和遊戲不會被動到。你可以從「設定」>「Wii U Menu」再次匯入 Menu。";
"This device" = "此裝置";
"This device doesn't support mesh shaders, so graphic packs that rely on geometry shaders or post-processing (RECTS) draws may not render correctly. Everything else works normally." = "此裝置不支援網格著色器，因此依賴幾何著色器或後期處理 (RECTS) 繪製的圖形包可能無法正確呈現。其他一切都正常運作。";
"This device doesn't support mesh shaders, so some graphic packs may not render correctly. See Graphic Packs below." = "此裝置不支援網格著色器，因此部分圖形包可能無法正確呈現。請見下方的「圖形包」。";
