"This install" = "此安裝";
"This is %@, not %@. Use the other import option." = "這是 %@，不是 %@。請使用另一個匯入選項。";
"This is a %@ pipeline cache and the renderer is set to %@, so it won't be used until you switch in Settings > Graphics. It's saved under its own name and will be picked up then." = "這是 %@ 管線快取，而轉譯器設定為 %@，因此在你於「設定」>「圖形」中切換之前不會使用。它會以自己的名稱儲存，屆時會被採用。";
"This is the experimental pad. Its size, colours and layout presets are in Settings." = "這是實驗性的搖桿面板。其大小、顏色和版面預設組合在「設定」中。";
"This is the save the game itself writes. It uses the Wii U's own format, so it can move between MuffinEMU, desktop Cemu and a real console. A save state is a snapshot of the whole emulated console and only MuffinEMU can read it.\n\nExport writes a folder named after the game and title ID. Import accepts that folder, a folder named after the title ID from another Cemu install, or its 'user' folder. Importing replaces the current save; the old one is first copied to save-backups in MuffinEMU's Documents folder." = "這是遊戲本身寫入的存檔。它使用 Wii U 自己的格式，因此可以在 MuffinEMU、桌面版 Cemu 和真正的主機之間移動。快速存檔是整個模擬主機的快照，只有 MuffinEMU 能讀取。\n\n匯出會寫出以遊戲和標題 ID 命名的檔案夾。匯入接受該檔案夾、來自另一個 Cemu 安裝以標題 ID 命名的檔案夾，或其 'user' 檔案夾。匯入會取代目前的存檔；舊的存檔會先拷貝到 MuffinEMU 的 Documents 檔案夾中的 save-backups。";
"This isn't a Wii U DLC or update file." = "這不是 Wii U 的 DLC 或更新檔案。";
"This isn't a Wii U game file MuffinEMU can read. It accepts .wua, .wux, .wud, .iso, .rpx, .elf and .wuhb files, or a game folder. Encrypted games also need keys.txt." = "這不是 MuffinEMU 可以讀取的 Wii U 遊戲檔案。支援 .wua、.wux、.wud、.iso、.rpx、.elf 和 .wuhb 檔案，或遊戲檔案夾。加密的遊戲還需要 keys.txt。";
"This pack won't activate" = "此套件包無法啟用";
"This replaces %@'s current save. The one you have now is backed up first, and the game should be closed before you do this." = "這會取代 %@ 目前的存檔。你現有的存檔會先備份，且執行此操作前應先關閉遊戲。";
