"Until you choose a value, MuffinEMU picks one itself: if a game hasn't started drawing after 12 seconds, it slows its clock a step (down to 1/64). Choosing a value here turns that off.\n\nWithout the recompiler the emulated CPU is much slower than the console's, so games can fall behind their own timers and never draw a frame. Slowing the game's clock gives them room. Emulation accuracy isn't affected." = "在你選擇一個值之前，MuffinEMU 會自行選擇：如果遊戲在 12 秒後仍未開始繪製，它會將時脈降低一級（最低到 1/64）。在這裡選擇一個值就會關閉這項功能。\n\n沒有重新編譯器時，模擬的 CPU 比主機的慢很多，因此遊戲可能落後於自己的計時器，永遠畫不出一個影格。降低遊戲的時脈可以給它們空間。模擬準確度不受影響。";
