"Games read the console's clock for daily events, timed unlocks and seasons. Turn off \"Use this device's date and time\" to pick another date; the clock keeps running from it, between launches too, as a Wii U's clock did.\n\nWhile a game runs, HOME > Console clock moves its clock forward by an hour up to a year, or by an amount you choose. That change is kept here. Some games only check the date when they start, so quit and start them again to see it.\n\nThis isn't Emulated Clock, which changes how fast time passes inside a game." = "遊戲會讀取主機的時鐘來處理每日活動、限時解鎖和季節。關閉「使用此裝置的日期與時間」即可選擇另一個日期；時鐘會從該時間繼續走，即使結束再啟動也一樣，就像 Wii U 的時鐘那樣。\n\n遊戲執行時，HOME > 主機時鐘可將其時鐘快轉一小時到一年，或你選擇的時長。這項更改會保存在這裡。有些遊戲只在啟動時檢查日期，所以要結束並重新啟動才能看到變化。\n\n這不是「模擬時脈」，後者改變的是遊戲內時間流逝的快慢。";
